<pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I48d74e415825e11e5fcf1ad2ba932fd2442d57f9" commit="5ce519d6fe3186e062e1b8418c65c0c9597e4a95" commit_message="test list: allow pattern matching for skipped tests  If a test is skipped in SMT, it is usually skipped in other stations too.  With this CL, instead of writing:      [         'SMT.AudioJack',         'FFT.AudioJack',         'FAT.AudioJack',         'FOO.BAR.AudioJack'     ]  Now you only need to write:      [ '*.AudioJack' ]  to skip all AudioJack tests.  Note that 'SMT.AudioJack-2' is not matched.  (Because this might be a test for different audio component, and should not be skipped).  BUG=b:31678190 TEST=make test  Change-Id: I48d74e415825e11e5fcf1ad2ba932fd2442d57f9 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/600347 Commit-Ready: Wei-Han Chen &lt;stimim@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Wei-Han Chen &lt;stimim@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Pi-Hsun Shih &lt;pihsun@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="600347" owner_email="stimim@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/platform/factory" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/factory" ref="refs/changes/47/600347/2" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Ib51be698bd829f04fc9f89004d141441e3987b07" commit="5c9774c1768a42b6d9d816e5303933b28ed14805" commit_message="test list iterator: add unittest for skipped tests  When a test is skipped by options.skipped_tests, they should never be run.  Add unittest to assert that.  BUG=b:31678190 TEST=make test  Change-Id: Ib51be698bd829f04fc9f89004d141441e3987b07 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/600348 Commit-Ready: Wei-Han Chen &lt;stimim@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Wei-Han Chen &lt;stimim@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Pi-Hsun Shih &lt;pihsun@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="600348" owner_email="stimim@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="2" project="chromiumos/platform/f